h1. Auto-Updater Force Install Bug Analysis

h2. Executive Summary

The Force Install checkbox in the Commerce Central deployment template UI is not working because the {{forceInstall}} value is never propagated from the UI through to the {{TargetVersionModel}} in the database. This causes the manifest XML to always show {{force="false"}} regardless of the checkbox state.

----

h2. Root Cause

The issue occurs in the deployment assignment flow. When assigning deployment targets:

# ✅ The UI correctly captures the Force Install checkbox value
# ✅ The value is saved to {{DeploymentTemplateStep.forceInstall}} in the database
# ❌ *BUG*: When assigning versions to groups, the {{forceInstall}} flag is NOT passed to the update management service
# ❌ *BUG*: The {{AssignVersionRequest}} model doesn't have a field for force/forceFlag
# ❌ *BUG*: The {{InstallRepository.scheduleVersion()}} method doesn't set the {{forceFlag}} on the {{TargetVersionModel}}

----

