# *State Transition Overhead* - Each state transition performs expensive component resolution, sorting, and injection/outjection cycles in {{ShowScreenAfterActionLoop}} (~20-40ms per transition)

# *Repeated Configuration Lookups* - States like {{CheckForAddBagsState}} fetch configuration from database on every arrival without caching (~50-100ms per lookup)

