The platform already supports configurable tax aggregators via {{openpos.sell.taxAggregator}} property (confirmed in TransDocumentAdapter.java {{getTaxAggregator()}} method). Create a new {{ITaxAggregator}} implementation that sums all taxes into a single "Tax" line.

*Step 1: Create new SimpleTaxAggregator class*

