h3. Summary: Use IFinalizeSaleSessionListener (Recommended)

The customer's current approach using transaction lifecycle listeners is the *correct and recommended pattern*. Overriding {{TransRepository.save()}} is *strongly discouraged* due to high maintenance burden and upgrade risks.

