#### Root Cause Analysis

The issue occurred due to a deployment sequence violation where SymmetricDS trigger configuration was deployed to Central before the corresponding tables existed in downstream BU/Fixed environments. This caused "table not found" errors that prevented automatic trigger creation.

*Evidence:*

* Diagnostic findings show triggers propagated to BU/Fixed before tables existed
* Code analysis reveals {{haveTriggersBeenCreated()}} method in {{SymDSInitStatusProvider.java}} incorrectly handles missing tables
* Manual fix involved updating {{sym_trigger}} table to force trigger regeneration
* Similar behavior observed in QA environment indicates systemic deployment process issue

#### Affected Components

* *SymDSInitStatusProvider*: Contains faulty completion check logic
* *ITriggerRouterService*: Provides trigger information but can't fix the completion check
* *SymmetricDS Configuration*: Propagates trigger config before table existence verified
* *sym_trigger_hist table*: Maintains failed trigger creation states

#### Recommended Fix

h3. Step 1: Modify Trigger Completion Check Logic

*File:* {{symmetric-core/src/main/java/org/jumpmind/symmetric/service/impl/SymDSInitStatusProvider.java}}

*Problem:* The {{haveTriggersBeenCreated()}} method incorrectly returns {{true}} when tables don't exist, preventing trigger creation later.

*Fix:* Update the condition to properly handle table existence checks:

{code:java}// File: symmetric-core/src/main/java/org/jumpmind/symmetric/service/impl/SymDSInitStatusProvider.java
private boolean haveTriggersBeenCreated() {
    ITriggerRouterService triggerRouterService = symmetricEngine.getTriggerRouterService();
    Map<String, List<TriggerHistory>> triggerHistoryMap = triggerRouterService.getActiveTriggerHistories()
            .stream()
            .collect(Collectors.groupingBy(TriggerHistory::getTriggerId));
    return triggerRouterService.getTriggersForCurrentNode(true).stream()
            .allMatch(trigger -> triggerHistoryMap.get(trigger.getTriggerId()) != null ||
            (symmetricEngine.getDatabasePlatform().getTableFromCache(
                trigger.getSourceCatalogName(), 
                trigger.getSourceSchemaName(), 
                trigger.getSourceTableName(), 
