* {{12:02:22.387}} Received action from 86050-001 {{{"name":"Scan"...}}}

Scan counts for seq {{542}}

* Total Scan actions received: *6*
* Scan timestamps: {{12:02:18.504}}, {{12:02:20.506}}, {{12:02:20.961}}, {{12:02:21.258}}, {{12:02:21.825}}, {{12:02:22.387}}
