TVS reported an issue that occurred in one of their stores on 6/8/24.  When the associate scanned items, the items were not displayed on the customer display.  Only the total appeared to increase as items were scanned and added (See attached image).

After investigating the logs, it looks like the customer display customer display got stuck in a look handling the following action.  I’m not entirely sure how it got stuck just by looking at the logs.  The only way TVS could correct the issue was by restarting the fixed service.

{noformat}{
  "name" : "SellItemsData",
  "type" : "Screen",
  "doNotBlockForResponse" : true
} {noformat}


I have attached logs with this incident.  The looping appears to begin at line 23032.

