On top of the 2 existing options in 243.4, we need a 3rd option of Pre-Auth of Special Order tender amount being $0.00. This is because TVS just captures the token from the $0.00 pre-auth and passed it on to OMS for action post shipping on the real capture of funds. And the requirement at TVS is not to put a hold on the customer’s amount till OMS acts on the capture.

I understand currently JMC supports

{{ORDER_PRE_AUTH}}

{{ORDER_PURCHASE_AUTH}}

might need a configurable 3rd flavor

{quote}We need to be able to get gift receipts for gift card issue/reload transactions.
However, JMC has this code in base:

public boolean isGiftReceiptApplicable() {
return getItemType().equals(*ItemTypeCode.STOCK*) && !isItemReturned();
}

Since gift cards have an *ItemTypeCode = GIFTCARD*, we are unable to do gift receipts for gift card issue/reload transactions.
Can we make this setting configurable in the next point release?{quote}

