# GC issue -> select amount 
# scan/enter GC card to the transaction.
# tender the transaction, with Card. 
# select "card" -> "usd card tender amount" screen, Select "next" 
# wait till the pin pad gets to "present card" screen.  then press "cancel" on POS. 

*Actual:* tender is completed by using the GC scanned for Issue/load. 

*Expected:* Card tender canceled and POS getting back to select tender screen.

