	at org.jumpmind.pos.core.service.UIDataMessageProviderService.getNextDataChunk(UIDataMessageProviderService.java:110)
	at org.jumpmind.pos.core.service.UIDataMessageProviderService.lambda$updateProviders$3(UIDataMessageProviderService.java:75)
	at java.base/java.util.HashMap.forEach(HashMap.java:1421)
	at org.jumpmind.pos.core.service.UIDataMessageProviderService.updateProviders(UIDataMessageProvi{noformat}



When the order history tab is enabled, I do not see this issue in the logs, and the vouchers display correctly.  I’ve attached a screenshot of the issue as well as logs for when the order history tab is enabled and logs for when it is disabled.

